"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121026","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121026.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121026.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-07T14:40:40Z"},"body":"In `character_body_2d.cpp`, there is code whose compilation is controlled by `DISABLE_DEPRECATED`, including\r\n```cpp\r\n#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED\r\n#include \"servers/physics_2d/physics_server_2d_extension.h\"\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nWhen compiling with the `deprecated=no` option, `physics_server_2d.h`—which is indirectly included by that header—is also excluded; consequently, any code accessing `PhysicsServer2D` results in a compilation error(`name followed by '::' must be a class or namespace name`).\r\n<img width=\"1128\" height=\"129\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0a54e7d-5b08-4e10-a385-9422c1b8b0b7\" />","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/